# Calendar Application Architecture

## Overview

This calendar application follows the PRD requirements and implements a Google Calendar-inspired interface using Material Design 3 components.

## Architecture

### State Management

- **CalendarContext** (`client/context/CalendarContext.tsx`): Central state management for:
  - Calendars (Personal, Work, Family) with toggle functionality
  - Events with CRUD operations
  - Selected date and view mode
  - Uses React Context API for global state

### Component Structure

#### Main Components

1. **Index.tsx** - Main page component
   - Wraps app in CalendarProvider
   - Manages dialog state
   - Coordinates between header, sidebar, and views

2. **CalendarHeader** - Top navigation bar
   - Create event button
   - Navigation controls (Previous, Next, Today)
   - View mode switcher (Month/Year)
   - Displays current period

3. **CalendarSidebar** - Left sidebar
   - MiniCalendar for quick date navigation
   - Calendar list with checkboxes for filtering
   - Hidden on mobile (< 768px)

4. **MonthView** - Traditional calendar grid
   - 6 weeks x 7 days grid
   - Shows up to 3 events per day
   - "+X more" indicator for additional events
   - Click date to create event
   - Click event to edit

5. **YearView** - 12-month overview
   - Grid of 12 mini calendars
   - Shows which dates have events (dots)
   - Click any date to select and create event

6. **EventDialog** - Create/Edit modal
   - Title, description, date/time fields
   - Calendar selection dropdown
   - Validation: disables save until all required fields filled
   - Delete with confirmation
   - Smart defaults from PRD

7. **MiniCalendar** - Compact calendar in sidebar
   - Month navigation
   - Date selection
   - Shows event indicators (dots)

### Utilities

- **dateUtils.ts** - Date manipulation helpers
  - Format dates and times
  - Navigate months/years
  - Get calendar grids
  - Check today, same day, etc.

## Key Features Implemented

### Event Management
- ✅ Create events with title, date/time, description
- ✅ Edit existing events
- ✅ Delete with confirmation
- ✅ Color-coded by calendar
- ✅ Events display time + title

### Calendar Organization
- ✅ Multiple calendars (Personal, Work, Family)
- ✅ Toggle calendars on/off to filter events
- ✅ Color-coded calendars
- ✅ Visual muting when disabled

### Views
- ✅ Month View - traditional grid
- ✅ Year View - 12 mini months
- ❌ Week/Day Views - planned for future

### Navigation
- ✅ Previous/Next buttons
- ✅ Today button
- ✅ View switcher
- ✅ Mini calendar date selection
- ✅ Click dates to select

### Smart Defaults (from PRD)
- ✅ Selected date → event defaults to that date
- ✅ Otherwise → defaults to today
- ✅ Time → current hour + 1 hour duration
- ✅ Calendar → first enabled calendar

### Mobile Responsive
- ✅ Sidebar hidden on mobile (< 768px)
- ✅ Header reorganizes on small screens
- ✅ Touch-friendly tap targets
- ✅ Responsive grid layouts

