## Material Web Components Used

- `md-filled-button` - Primary actions
- `md-outlined-button` - Secondary actions, view switcher
- `md-text-button` - Dialog actions
- `md-icon-button` - Navigation arrows
- `md-icon` - Icons
- `md-dialog` - Event create/edit modal
- `md-filled-text-field` - Form inputs
- `md-filled-select` / `md-select-option` - Calendar picker
- `md-checkbox` - Calendar toggles

## Styling Approach

- Material Design 3 color tokens from `global.css`
- Inline styles for component-specific layouts
- CSS classes for responsive breakpoints
- Hover states for interactive elements
- Smooth transitions

## Future Enhancements

As noted in PRD, future versions could add:
- Recurring events
- All-day events
- Week/Day views
- Drag-and-drop rescheduling
- Search and advanced filters
- Cloud sync
- Notifications
- Accessibility improvements (keyboard navigation, ARIA labels)

## Development Notes

- All components use React hooks
- Event handlers follow Material Web Component patterns (onClick, onInput)
- Boolean attributes handled correctly (true/undefined pattern)
- useMemo for form validation
- Component files kept focused and modular
